{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-17_beg",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-17",
  "title": "晶簇之內",
  "storyCode": "14-19",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-17_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7c67bcb2ffbcb9174347ed493ef6735a9a72eaa614a10e313982e2351532bf28",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你可能記不清今天對你來說，究竟意味著什麼。\n這會讓你陷入十分危險的處境。\n……\n不。\n你必須想起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……狀態……正常……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……抱歉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又讓你受苦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士，抓緊我的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下次請不要再一聲不響地離開我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也不會再接受這種事了，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……怎麼了，Dr.{@nickname}……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼要用這麼陌生的眼神看著我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（“未知語言”）普瑞……賽斯……？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "欸，你又從哪裡學來了這麼奇怪的語言？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這次休眠你又偷偷將思維上傳到某個旋臂末端的文明中了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "好了，再確認一下你的語言功能恢復得如何。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "別說你睡了一場大覺，連我的名字都忘了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "來，再叫一次我的名字，數據庫會分析你的所有聲音數據。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "普瑞……賽斯……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "恢復得很快嘛，{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但是你的身體剛剛復甦，還沒有完全適應。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "急著亂動的話，小心NX-07把你按回床鋪哦。它新換的指令很難解開，就連我都愛莫能助。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你……我在哪裡？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "當然還在“羅德島”，我們的家。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "只有……我一個人？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
              "speakerToken": null,
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "怎麼會只有你呢？我也在這裡呀。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "羅德島的……其他人呢……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
              "speakerToken": null,
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "……你果然還是會這樣問。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "變故發生得很快。防禦矩陣損傷超過了百分之九十，受極端環境影響，修理單元也很難在短時間內恢復工作。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在你休眠後不久，許多同事就相繼離開了這裡……大家都很珍惜這星星墜落之前的時間，我很理解。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "現在，的確只有我們兩個了。當然，AMa-10也還在，而且精神很好，很活潑。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "別擔心，羅德島剩下的部分還可以維繫基本功能，我們還有一點時間。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "{@nickname}，你在我身邊的時候，我並不害怕結局。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "無論是構成我們身體的物質崩毀，我們的意識停止變化，還是宇宙的法則顛倒，我都可以坦然接受。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "只要你還在我身邊就夠了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你還在出神，是還沒從夢裡醒來嗎，{@nickname}？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她握著你的手，貼在了自己的臉頰上。\n肌膚的觸感溫暖而真實，將你從夢裡拉回現實。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果是這樣，我想知道你的夢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不過，裡面最好有我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……夢嗎……？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……很長的夢嗎……？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "“泰拉”。\n那片大地……天災……礦石病……\n可你已經漫步在那片大地上數年，一切都如此真實。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "人群的歡呼依舊在你耳邊迴盪。\n天災不曾摧毀希望，在苦難的創傷下，你依然可以觸碰那恆久的餘溫。\n溫暖的。動人的。你被包圍在溫柔的人群之中……\n“羅德島”。\n你永遠不會忘記的羅德島。\n治癒過你傷痕的羅德島……曾留下過遺憾的羅德島……\n你不是依然站在這裡嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "和他們一起，你去過冰雪覆蓋之地。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "也感受過沙灘的柔軟。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "見證他們活著……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "見證他們離去……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他們使你確信——\n在本該被焚盡的不公之地……理想亦應是信念。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "陪伴理想主義者跨越熱浪，不論是否被熱浪灼傷。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你看到帝國的齷齪，也感受到無力反抗命運的悲涼……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你不會忘記……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "——她。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她從未離開你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他們都從未離開。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "“博士……”\n“博士！”"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（“未知語言”）阿米婭……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你又走神了，嘴裡又開始唸著這些不屬於我們的語言。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那些經歷……很真實。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "那不是夢。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這不是很正常嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "定義夢與現實的權力，一直都掌握在我們手中，{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "當我們的思維在寰宇中穿梭億萬光年，參加那些於冰凍曠野中向白矮星祭拜生命的儀式時，我們該如何定義這樣的體驗呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "等你的思維回到這具身體後，你又如何分辨億萬年後才會被捕獲的資訊是夢還是現實？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "等等，你該不會真的在思考這件事吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "普瑞賽斯……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "怎麼了，{@nickname}？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我不曾見過你，可為何你的名字，我卻能脫口而出？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不曾見過……你還是發現了啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我很高興聽到你這麼說，這意味著你距離找到真正的我，已經很近了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可是我還是忍不住有些失望。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "因為那個小小的意外，你的記憶……的確受到了無法逆轉的損傷，就連我也無能為力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這裡……也是羅德島？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我以前來過這裡嗎？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這裡嘛……“不可知”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們一起建造這個地方的時候，曾經許下過一個共同的願望。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "等到群星的最後一絲溫熱消散，時間的路網完全陷入混亂的那一天，就讓黑暗成為我們共同的被子吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……聽起來很像一座墳墓。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "等到這個世界，這片星空迎來最後的時刻……我們的宇宙本來就會變成一座巨大的墳墓。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "沒有任何一顆星球的角落藏著希望。但凡有一顆宇宙碎片的微粒上藏著救贖的答案，它也一定已經被我們打撈起來了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "每一次的反抗都以提前毀滅告終，每一次的探索只會帶來更深重的絕望……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "結論是那麼簡單。任何以正常物質為基礎的生命形式都無法逃離。任何一種已知的技術，都無法克服那絕對的終結。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "抱歉，{@nickname}……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我只是，很久沒有機會向你傾訴了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們的關係……很親密？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "親密？我不會用這種字眼來形容我們之間的關係。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這是對我們過去所經歷的一切的貶低。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我並不記得。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "沒關係的，我並不生氣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "就算你的大腦不再記得，你的意識深處，那些任何儀器都無法捕捉到的地方……一定還留存著我的痕跡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不然的話……你怎麼會任由我像這樣，一直拉著你的手呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "嗯……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "過去我們也常常這麼做嗎？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "“牽手”——嗯，我們有很多種不同方式的“牽手”。很多時候並不需要借助軀體的某些特定部分。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們第一次見面的時候……我正在環繞著一顆海洋星球飛行。我把恆星當作不變的錨，沿著晝夜分界線，飛了一圈又一圈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "恆星的死亡來得很快。我身下的海洋幾乎在一瞬間離解了，露出了星球赤裸的暗紅色脊骨。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "有人從身後拉住了我，把我拽到了一處更安靜的星雲裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那個人向我解釋，知道我很可能不會有危險，但那個人來不及確認我的本體在哪個星場中，只能用自己的船打撈了我的意識信標。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那是我第一次登上那艘卵形的船。它並不大，可是很靈活，已經去過無數個星系。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我把船帶到了一顆並不算熱鬧的行星上。我向船的主人展示了我面向大海的小實驗室，並且走到了那個人的面前。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "就像這樣……我握住了對方的手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "“我叫普瑞賽斯，語言學家。我正在研究行星死去時發出的最後聲波。我喜歡安靜地獨處，但也想和合適的人一起探索宇宙。”"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "接下來……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "該你啦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我？自我介紹嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我是……{@nickname}。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "真好啊，我們又認識了一回。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "對了，你當時也有些猶豫。在那個時代……人們已經越來越少像這樣親密相處。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "好在，我們是同類。你無私地向我分享了你的旅行見聞，並對我發起了邀請。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們跳躍在時間與空間之中，去往宇宙的各個角落。有時是乘坐著你的船，更多時候是透過意識穿梭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你向我描繪不同文明的興衰迭起、隱藏在群星誕生與毀滅中的規律。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們的思維在相互碰撞中無限迭代，直至駐足回首時才發現，我們已經超越了其他人太多太多……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她的手中翻轉出一枚無比純淨的晶體。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……源石。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們爭論與碰撞的結晶，凝結了無數先驅守望宇宙時留下的真理。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "它是如此美麗……"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她將源石輕輕地放在了你的手中，握住你的手，共同捧起這美輪美奐的造物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "所有人都說，我是那個創造了源石與未來，像“神明”一般的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但我一直都知道，真正的天才是你，{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你忘記了……但你不該忘記。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在創造它的路上，我不斷地追趕你的腳步。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我害怕在某一次與你辯論時掉隊，害怕讓你發現我本來不如你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不，或許你發現了……也許你也曾放慢腳步等我，等待我追上你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可是現在，我永遠都不會知道答案了……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你……很在意？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在意，但我接受這個事實。倒不如說，這讓我喜悅。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你依舊藏著許多令我著迷的秘密。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "況且，對你而言，現在的我同樣如此。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "難道不是嗎，{@nickname}？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我……的確還有很多的困惑。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那就繼續在這個地方尋找答案吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這是我們共同的造物，共同的過去，也藏著我們共同的秘密。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "只要你和我同行——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "抱歉，但現在我有更在意的事。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我必須先確認更重要的事。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我本來想跟你分享一些我一直替你保存的東西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那些你曾經向我描繪，如今你自己卻已全然忘記的理念和願景……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我想讓你知道我們所取得的成就。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "也許是這樣，你能想起過去，想起我——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但我能看見你所想，我能感受你所思。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "就像此刻，你的腦海中依舊縈繞著無窮的疑惑……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "“阿米婭”“凱爾希”——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "——！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我……不想讓你為難，我尊重你的選擇。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她的手觸碰到了黑暗——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但我很確定……{@nickname}……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "當你真正對一切感到困惑的時候，你會想起——答案一直都在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
